<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 600" width="800" height="600">
  <rect width="800" height="600" fill="#f8f9fa"/>
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="800" height="60" fill="#1a3a5c"/>
  <text x="400" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" font-family="sans-serif">交通慢行与蓝绿公共空间系统</text>
  <text x="400" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#aabbcc" font-size="13" font-family="sans-serif">Mobility & Blue-Green Public Space System</text>
  <text x="400" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif">Submissions/777-shj/jingzhang-ai-innovation-belt</text>
  <text x="400" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666" font-size="12" font-family="sans-serif">Provisional Boundary | EPSG:4326 | Design Concept Only</text>
  <line x1="50" y1="140" x2="750" y2="140" stroke="#ddd" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="50" y="170" fill="#333" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">以京张遗址公园为慢行主轴，串联清河滨水绿廊、小月河蓝绿空间、轨道站点一体化节点和AI场景展示广场，形成南北贯通、东西缝合的慢行网络。</text>
  <text x="50" y="190" fill="#666" font-size="12" font-family="sans-serif">The Jing-Zhang Heritage Park serves as the slow-traffic spine, connecting the Qinghe Riverfront, Xiaoyuehe blue-green space, transit hubs, and AI scenario plazas.</text>
  <rect x="50" y="210" width="700" height="350" rx="5" fill="#e8ecf0" stroke="#ccc" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="400" y="390" text-anchor="middle" fill="#999" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif">Figure: 交通慢行与蓝绿公共空间系统</text>
  <text x="400" y="410" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bbb" font-size="11" font-family="sans-serif">Generated from geometry/*.geojson and metrics.json</text>
  <text x="50" y="575" fill="#999" font-size="10" font-family="sans-serif">Source: Provisional boundaries from brief/site-package/geometry/provisional_boundaries.geojson</text>
  <text x="50" y="590" fill="#999" font-size="10" font-family="sans-serif">Status: provisional_constraint | Not for official redline or precise area calculation</text>
